---
Build and package standalone GUI for Linux native (non-WSL).

Ensure the standalone builds and runs on native Linux with ALSA or
PulseAudio audio backend.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] CMake builds on Ubuntu 22.04+ natively
- [ ] Audio output works via ALSA or PulseAudio (through SDL2)
- [ ] AppImage or .deb packaging script
- [ ] Desktop entry file included

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build on native Linux, verify executable runs
- [ ] Verify audio output works (not just WSLg)
- [ ] Package as AppImage, test on clean Ubuntu install
